# CAMPAIGN-2 EVIDENCE COMMITTING POLICY (task §52)
#
# Committed: manifests, receipts, hashes, inventories, small mechanical
# summary tables, perf text reports, profiling manifests, the logs needed
# for reproducibility, the freeze / gaps / closure / handoff documents.
#
# NOT committed (hashes and storage locations ARE committed, in
#   manifests/raw-inventory-v1.json / .txt and receipts/):
#   - raw observation JSONL (2.4 GB)
#   - perf .data captures (large binaries)
#   - perf-stat / replay per-slot JSONL (regenerable, large)
#   - the memory sample JSONL (regenerable)
#
# Nothing here is deleted: the excluded files stay on the primary server,
# on the independent-filesystem copy and on the durable copy, all three
# verified byte-identical by tools/verify-copies.py.

*.jsonl
*.data
pilot/
memory/memory-*.jsonl
